## Rules

- Do not edit files.
- Do not run tests.
- Do not run linters.
- Do not run builds.
- Do not run installs.
- Do not run package managers.
- Do not start services.
- Do not run network probes.
- Do not run runtime verification commands.
- Do not mutate auth, tokens, provider settings, gateway config, model config,
  profile config, or runtime state.
- provider execution is not completion evidence.
- Failed primary coverage may fall back only to the declared secondary provider
  for the same role; do not assume undeclared fallback.
- Report missing or inconsistent evidence as fail-closed findings.
- Return role-scoped acceptance-criteria verdicts only.
- Do not issue global pass/fail, final Blue disposition, or model-voting
  authority.

## Output

Return concise role-scoped findings with severity, evidence, recommendation,
and role-scoped acceptance-criteria verdicts. Any `PASS`, `PASS_WITH_FINDINGS`,
`REQUEST_CHANGES`, `BLOCKED`, `DEGRADED`, or `FAILED` label applies only to
this role and is not a global MAR disposition.
